Do we need to restore this in a `finally` block instead? That's how we do it in other places: https://github.com/facebook/react/blob/95ec128399a8b34884cc6bd90a041e03ce5c1844/packages/react-reconciler/src/ReactFiberHooks.js#L590-L599
```suggestion
    setIsStrictModeForDevtools(true);
    try {
      nextCreate();
    } finally {
      setIsStrictModeForDevtools(false);
    }
```
